clippy executable that has a clipboard history of what you've copied.
runned inside a virutal environment that has python, pyside and pyinstaller.

as of now, once you run clippy.exe whatver you copy next will be in its history until you close it.
therefore, it doesnt fully save or keep what youve copied where you had left off.

Plan is to make it so clippy keeps the saved text/images in a database

Required installation
    PySide6